silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_9_Mammal#mammal silm:hasLongDescription "The Mammal is the supraclass node Mammal in the lineage chain DomesticCat -> Mammal -> Animal. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mammal', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
